            desc = "bit[17]: Whether there are sync signals in three channels during component output. This bit takes effect only when the sync_mode_scart bit is set to 0. 0: Only one channel contains sync signals during component output. 1: Three channels contain sync signals during component output. When bit 17 is set to 0, the sync channel must be the Y channel for YPbPr output or G channel for RGB output. bit[16]: Whether there are blanking radixes during RGB output. 0: There are no blanking radixes during RGB output. 1: There are blanking radixes during RGB output.";
            sw = rw;
            hw = r;
            reset = 0x0;
